    "body": "This is looking good to me so far! 👍\r\nThis seems like an elegant way to support left/right prompts in a shell-agnostic way. 😊 \r\n\r\nUnfortunately, I'm having no luck on my end getting it to work locally. Seemingly some part of root config loading isn't pulling in `format_right`, despite being set. I'll try to do some digging on my end when I've got a little more time to spare.\r\n\r\nAs for testing, I we don't need anything too rigorous, but a few tests to make sure that we're correctly handling some basic cases would be appreciated:\r\n- Correctly rendering left/right prompts on multi-line prompts\r\n- Left-only and right-only prompts\r\n- Terminal width can't be identified (if it can be easily tested)",
